WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:05.940
Marvel Studios grabbed headlines with its
presentation of the MCU Phase 4 slate at SDCC

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:07.040
2019.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:10.960
And along with the intriguing new titles came
some enticing cast announcements.

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:15.740
These are just some of the actors set to make
a big splash in the MCU, along with some clues

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:17.420
as to where you've seen them before.

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:23.640
At the 2019 San Diego Comic-Con, Marvel Studios
revealed some details of its long-anticipated

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:28.419
Black Widow standalone movie, including the
confirmation that rising English star Florence

00:00:28.419 --> 00:00:33.200
Pugh would portray a character named Yelena
Belova, who the actress described as a "sister

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.920
figure" to Natasha Romanoff.

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:39.040
Pugh first appeared on screen in the 2014
British film The Falling.

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:43.260
From there she moved on to the romantic drama
Lady Macbeth, which she followed with a role

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:47.320
as Cordelia in the 2018 TV movie version of
King Lear.

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:52.160
More recently, she had roles in Chris Pine's
14th century Scottish epic Outlaw King and

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:55.960
AMC's assassin thriller miniseries The Little
Drummer Girl.

00:00:55.960 --> 00:01:01.120
Pugh is having a very good 2019; just before
the announcement that she'd co-star in Black

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:06.640
Widow, she played a younger version of real-life
WWE wrestler Paige in the well-received comedy

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:07.920
Fighting with My Family.

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:12.260
She followed that immediately with the lead
role in Midsommar, the critical darling of

00:01:12.260 --> 00:01:16.980
a horror movie about a weird Swedish cult
and its not-so-innocuous solstice festival.

00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:22.420
The upcoming Black Widow movie will also include
a character named Rick Mason, a former S.H.I.E.L.D.

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:25.180
contact of Natasha's and a possible love interest.

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:28.980
Landing that pivotal role: London-born actor
O-T Fagbenle.

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:33.100
His Black Widow gig is the role that will
likely make him a household name, as up to

00:01:33.109 --> 00:01:37.330
now he's primarily been a prolific actor on
a variety of British television series not

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:39.460
widely known outside the U.K.

00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:43.899
Though he started his career acting in plays,
Fagbenle eventually began to balance his stage

00:01:43.899 --> 00:01:49.189
work with TV, taking on parts in Britcoms
like Grownups, FM, and Material Girl, along

00:01:49.189 --> 00:01:51.180
with a couple of episodes of Doctor Who.

00:01:51.180 --> 00:01:55.939
He got his first major exposure stateside
on HBO's romantic drama Looking as Frank,

00:01:55.940 --> 00:01:58.080
a guy with some relationship problems.

00:01:58.080 --> 00:02:02.800
Fagbenle found his breakthrough role on Hulu's
harrowing, Emmy-winning adaptation of Margaret

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:04.540
Atwood's The Handmaid's Tale.

00:02:04.540 --> 00:02:09.220
He plays Luke Bankhole, husband of June, prior
to the dystopian revolution that resulted

00:02:09.220 --> 00:02:10.220
in Gilead.

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:15.620
In December 2018, Marvel informed fans that
a film about kung-fu master and superhero

00:02:15.620 --> 00:02:17.380
Shang-Chi was on the way.

00:02:17.380 --> 00:02:22.780
San Diego Comic-Con 2019 brought more news,
including a full title of Shang-Chi and the

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:27.209
Legend of the Ten Rings, and confirmation
that it would be Marvel's first movie headlined

00:02:27.209 --> 00:02:29.160
by actors of Asian descent.

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:32.480
Among the lead cast: rapper and actress Awkwafina.

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:36.940
Though her role remains undisclosed, her meteoric
rise in recent years makes her inclusion in

00:02:36.959 --> 00:02:39.629
Marvel's exciting new enterprise very noteworthy.

00:02:39.629 --> 00:02:44.340
Born under the name Nora Lum, Awkwafina first
gained attention for her music.

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:48.520
Her songs are frequently funny and satirical,
and that sense of humor led to supporting

00:02:48.530 --> 00:02:53.870
roles in comedy movies and TV shows, such
as sorority lady Christine in Neighbors 2

00:02:53.870 --> 00:02:57.620
and a recurring role as a mean video game
store employee on Future Man.

00:02:57.960 --> 00:03:01.560
"Hey, um…you're still dating that, like,
chemist guy, right?

00:03:01.560 --> 00:03:03.000
The, the…professor dude?"

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:04.220
"Lyle?

00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:05.340
No, we broke up.

00:03:05.340 --> 00:03:06.640
I call him 'Professor Ex' now."

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:08.460
"That's funny."

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:14.780
Awkwafina broke out in a big way in the summer
of 2018, appearing in two hit ensemble comedies

00:03:14.780 --> 00:03:18.700
and nearly stealing them both: Ocean's 8 and
Crazy Rich Asians.

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:23.480
Before you catch her in Shang-Chi when it
hits theaters in February 2021, Awkwafina

00:03:23.489 --> 00:03:28.190
can be seen in the lead role of indie dramedy
The Farewell, and will soon appear in Jumanji:

00:03:28.190 --> 00:03:32.409
The Next Level, the third SpongeBob Squarepants
movie, and the live-action remake of The Little

00:03:32.409 --> 00:03:33.720
Mermaid as Scuttle.

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:38.939
Chinese Canadian actor Simu Liu has built
up a solid acting resume, appearing on many

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:42.960
television series filmed in the Great White
North in extremely minor roles.

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:46.920
From there, though, he moved up to a recurring
role on the Canadian crime drama Blood and

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:52.420
Water and the central role of estranged son
Jung on the hit CBC sitcom Kim's Convenience.

00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:57.520
Liu made his way into American television
as ex-CIA guy Faaron on NBC's short-lived

00:03:57.520 --> 00:04:02.580
TV adaptation of Taken, and worked as a stunt
double on Heroes Reborn and Designated Survivor.

00:04:02.580 --> 00:04:07.120
In the spring of 2019, he guest-starred on
an episode of Fresh Off the Boat as a helpful

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:11.620
Taipei street vendor named Willie who helps
out broke, lost main character Eddie.

00:04:11.620 --> 00:04:15.760
Portraying Shang-Chi in Shang-Chi and the
Legend of the Ten Rings marks Liu's first

00:04:15.760 --> 00:04:17.560
starring role in a feature film.

00:04:17.800 --> 00:04:22.639
Marvel's Phase 4 will include The Eternals,
a story about alien immortals sent to Earth

00:04:22.640 --> 00:04:23.860
to protect humanity.

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:28.720
Joining an already-star-studded cast is Brian
Tyree Henry, who will portray Phastos.

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:34.460
Back in 2016, Henry found his breakout role:
world-weary, late-blooming rapper Alfred Miles,

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:35.180
a.k.a.

00:04:35.220 --> 00:04:38.440
Paper Boi, on Donald Glover's surreal FX dramedy
Atlanta.

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:39.940
"I don't know, he's kinda funny.

00:04:39.940 --> 00:04:42.100
I mean, he's hot right now you should work
with him.

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:45.360
I'm speaking as your manager, you know?"

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:48.440
"Just 'cause you're dressed like a sixth grader,
don't make you my manager, man."

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:53.000
Henry earned an Emmy nomination for his work,
but that's not the only awards attention he's

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:53.720
received.

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:57.920
Before moving into television and movies,
Henry put in some time on Broadway.

00:04:57.930 --> 00:05:01.640
He acted and sang as part of the ensemble
in The Book of Mormon, the musical by Trey

00:05:01.640 --> 00:05:03.630
Parker and Matt Stone of South Park.

00:05:03.630 --> 00:05:09.120
In 2018, he used part of his Atlanta hiatus
to return to the Great White Way, starring

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:12.480
in the play Lobby Hero, for which he received
a Tony Award nomination.

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:17.080
The exposure from Atlanta and Broadway helped
Henry move into film, and he's landed supporting

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:18.920
roles in many major movies.

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:24.340
In 2018, Henry appeared in three acclaimed
films: Widows, If Beale Street Could Talk,

00:05:24.349 --> 00:05:28.380
and Spider-Man: Into the Spider-Verse, in
which he lent his voice to the father of hero

00:05:28.380 --> 00:05:29.680
Miles Morales.

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:34.320
Henry co-starred as Detective Mike Norris
in the 2019 remake of Child's Play.

00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:38.560
He's also set to appear in Joker, Godzilla
vs. Kong, and A Quiet Place 2.

00:05:38.960 --> 00:05:43.540
A lot of actors struggle for years to find
work in major Hollywood blockbusters.

00:05:43.550 --> 00:05:47.539
Others get a little luck added to their talent,
and get asked to join the cast of, say, a

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:51.680
potentially huge Marvel Studios blockbuster
with only a handful of screen credits to their

00:05:51.680 --> 00:05:52.540
name.

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:57.800
The center of such a Hollywood success story:
actress Lauren Ridloff, cast as alien superhuman

00:05:57.800 --> 00:06:00.629
Makkari in Marvel's upcoming The Eternals.

00:06:00.629 --> 00:06:03.460
She'll play the first-ever deaf hero in the
MCU.

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:08.039
A former stay-at-home mom and Miss Deaf America,
Ridloff got into acting when she landed a

00:06:08.040 --> 00:06:12.580
part in If You Could Hear My Own Tune, a film
about how deaf people perceive music.

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:18.620
Ridloff then appeared in the fantastical Wonderstruck,
an episode of the CW supernatural series Legacies,

00:06:18.630 --> 00:06:21.230
and on an installment of NBC's medical drama
Margot.

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:25.630
Her most prominent role before The Eternals,
however, was portraying Hilltop survivor Connie

00:06:25.630 --> 00:06:27.820
during the ninth season of The Walking Dead.

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:32.639
Away from TV, Ridloff earned a Tony Award
nomination for her work in a revival of Children

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:33.640
of a Lesser God.

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:39.780
At the 2019 San Diego Comic-Con, Marvel announced
that a reboot of Blade was on the way not

00:06:39.780 --> 00:06:43.710
for its imminent slate of Marvel Cinematic
Universe "phase 4" movies, but as part of

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:45.240
the distant "Phase 5."

00:06:45.240 --> 00:06:49.340
Mahershala Ali, one of the most acclaimed
actors of his generation, will be playing

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:51.160
the titular vampire hunter.

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:55.760
Just days before his introduction as the new
Blade, Ali received an Emmy Award nomination

00:06:55.770 --> 00:07:00.409
for Outstanding Lead Actor in a Limited Series
or Movie for his work as a haunted Louisiana

00:07:00.409 --> 00:07:03.260
crime investigator on HBO's True Detective.

00:07:03.260 --> 00:07:08.259
And in February, 2019, Ali won an Academy
Award for Best Supporting Actor for Green

00:07:08.259 --> 00:07:13.169
Book in which he portrayed real-life pianist
Dr. Donald Shirley opposite his driver/bodyguard

00:07:13.169 --> 00:07:15.240
Tony, played by Viggo Mortensen.

00:07:15.980 --> 00:07:21.440
"You've impressed several people with your
innate ability to handle trouble.

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:25.720
And that is why I called and inquired about
your availability."

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:31.880
That made for Ali's second Oscar in just three
years he first won in 2017 for his work in

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:32.800
Moonlight.

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:37.800
Marvel Studios president Kevin Feige reported
that spinning Oscar gold into comic book vampire

00:07:37.800 --> 00:07:42.340
adventures was actually Ali's idea which just
makes us even more excited to see what he

00:07:42.340 --> 00:07:43.440
does with the role.

